04,"height":39},{"text":"PC","x":1650,"y":1138,"width":52,"height":30}]},{"text":"에서 개별 사용자가 실행하는 문서편집 프로그램은 프로세스이다. 마찬가지로 모바일 장","words":[{"text":"에서","x":332,"y":1197,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"개별","x":412,"y":1197,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"사용자가","x":491,"y":1197,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"실행하는","x":644,"y":1197,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"문서편집","x":794,"y":1198,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"프로그램은","x":947,"y":1200,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스이다.","x":1133,"y":1200,"width":216,"height":39},{"text":"마찬가지로","x":1364,"y":1201,"width":175,"height":39},{"text":"모바일","x":1552,"y":1200,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"장","x":1668,"y":1200,"width":36,"height":38}]},{"text":"치의 소설 미디어 앱도 프로세스이다. 지금은 프로세스가 실행 중인 프로그램의 인스턴","words":[{"text":"치의","x":333,"y":1263,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"소설","x":412,"y":1264,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"미디어","x":497,"y":1264,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"앱도","x":616,"y":1264,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스이다.","x":698,"y":1264,"width":219,"height":40},{"text":"지금은","x":936,"y":1264,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1054,"y":1265,"width":174,"height":39},{"text":"실행","x":1243,"y":1266,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"중인","x":1325,"y":1267,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램의","x":1410,"y":1266,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"인스턴","x":1601,"y":1265,"width":101,"height":38}]},{"text":"스라고 생각할 수 있지만 나중에 개념이 더 일반적이라는 것을 알게 될 것이다. 과에서","words":[{"text":"스라고","x":330,"y":1330,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"생각할","x":445,"y":1330,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":562,"y":1330,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있지만","x":613,"y":1330,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"나중에","x":729,"y":1330,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"개념이","x":850,"y":1330,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"더","x":969,"y":1331,"width":28,"height":39},{"text":"일반적이라는","x":1018,"y":1331,"width":206,"height":39},{"text":"것을","x":1240,"y":1331,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"알게","x":1320,"y":1331,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"될","x":1403,"y":1332,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1453,"y":1331,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"과에서","x":1577,"y":1331,"width":121,"height":40}]},{"text":"설명한 대로 프로세스가 서브프로세스를 작성하여 병행하게 실행할 수 있도록 하는 시","words":[{"text":"설명한","x":330,"y":1395,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"대로","x":448,"y":1396,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":531,"y":1397,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"서브프로세스를","x":723,"y":1397,"width":247,"height":39},{"text":"작성하여","x":984,"y":1397,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"병행하게","x":1142,"y":1397,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"실행할","x":1294,"y":1397,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1412,"y":1398,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"있도록","x":1466,"y":1397,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"하는","x":1583,"y":1398,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"시","x":1668,"y":1399,"width":29,"height":39}]},{"text":"스템 콜을 제공할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"스템","x":330,"y":1461,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"콜을","x":409,"y":1462,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"제공할","x":491,"y":1462,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":606,"y":1463,"width":35,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":656,"y":1463,"width":75,"height":40}]},{"text":"프로세스는 자기 일을 수행하기 위해 CPU 시간, 메모리, 파일, 그리고 입출력 장지","words":[{"text":"프로세스는","x":393,"y":1528,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"자기","x":578,"y":1528,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"일을","x":665,"y":1529,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"수행하기","x":745,"y":1528,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"위해","x":904,"y":1529,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"CPU","x":986,"y":1533,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"시간,","x":1085,"y":1529,"width":77,"height":41},{"text":"메모리,","x":1178,"y":1529,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"파일,","x":1304,"y":1529,"width":77,"height":40},{"text":"그리고","x":1396,"y":1529,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"입출력","x":1515,"y":1530,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"장지","x":1632,"y":1531,"width":64,"height":41}]},{"text":"를 포함한 여러 가지 자원을 필요로 한다. 이러한 자원은 보통 실행되는 동안 할당된다.","words":[{"text":"